# EFFIONG AI - environment variable template (for Hugging Face Spaces / Docker / Render / local shell)
# Same names as .streamlit/secrets.toml.example - see that file for what each key unlocks.
# Nothing is required: Effiong AI runs with zero keys using Pollinations + DuckDuckGo + local engines.

